                       pre[to[i]] = u;\n                        id[to[i]] = i;\n                        if (vis[to[i]] == 0) {\n                            vis[to[i]] = 1;\n                            q.offer(to[i]);\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            return d[t] < inf;\n        }\n\n        static int maxFlow(int s, int t) {\n            int sum = 0;\n            int totalCost = 0;\n            while (spfa(s, t)) {\n                int Mi = inf;\n                for (int i = t; i != s; i = pre[i]) {\n                    Mi = Math.min(Mi, w[id[i]]);\n                }\n                for (int i = t; i != s; i = pre[i]) {\n                    w[id[i]] -= Mi;\n                    w[id[i] ^ 1] += Mi;\n                }\n                totalCost += d[t] * Mi;\n                sum += Mi;\n            }\n            return totalCost;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        Graph.init();\n        int n = sc.nextInt();\n        int m = sc.nextInt();\n        int k = sc.nextInt();\n        int c = sc.nextInt();\n        int d = sc.nextInt();\n\n        s = 0;\n        t = n * 100 + 1;\n\n        for (int i = 1; i <= 100; ++i)\n            Graph.add(i, t, 100, 0);\n\n        for (int i = 1; i <= k; ++i) {\n            int v = sc.nextInt();\n            Graph.add(s, (v - 1) * 100 + 1, 1, 0);\n        }\n\n        for (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n            for (int j = 1; j < 100; ++j) {\n                int fromIdx = (i - 1) * 100 + j;\n                int toIdx = (i - 1) * 100 + j + 1;\n                Graph.add(fromIdx, toIdx, 100, c);\n            }\n        }\n\n        for (int i = 1; i <= m; ++i) {\n            int u = sc.nextInt();\n            int v = sc.nextInt();\n            for (int j = 1; j < 100; ++j) {\n                int idx = (u - 1) * 100 + j;\n                int idy = (v - 1) * 100 + j + 1;\n                for (int k = 1; k <= 50; ++k) {\n                    int costVal = c + (k * k - (k - 1) * (k - 1)) * d;\n                    Graph.add(idx, idy, 1, costVal);\n                }\n            }\n            for (int j = 1; j < 100; ++j) {\n                int idx = (v - 1) * 100 + j;\n                int idy = (u - 1) * 100 + j + 1;\n                for (int k = 1; k <= 50; ++k) {\n                    int costVal = c + (k * k - (k - 1) * (k - 1)) * d;\n                    Graph.add(idx, idy, 1, costVal);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        System.out.println(Graph.maxFlow(s, t));\n        sc.close();\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.9\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.0011274790158495307, -0.00023083435371518135, -1.5048530030981055e-06, -6.825890159234405e-05, -2.816093228830141e-06, -1.9361264946837764e-07, -0.0024758970830589533, -1.150050163269043, -0.15703538060188293, -6.704273118884885e-07, -0.0586770698428154, -0.04344478249549866, -0.011721037328243256, -0.0019295861711725593, -0.049201399087905884, -0.0003361774142831564, -0.3554140329360962, -1.723973582556937e-05, -0.0010380487656220794, -0.0002060436672763899, -3.8889261304575484e-06, 0.0, -5.3120038501219824e-05, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -6.630610641877865e-06, -4.320199877838604e-07, -0.004883738700300455, -0.0013854742283001542, -0.00043341092532500625, -0.9052656292915344, -0.03368915617465973, -0.25466442108154297, -7.44574936106801e-05, -6.659005157416686e-05, -1.9361264946837764e-07, -0.0012346376897767186, -4.842555426876061e-06, -3.4121114822482923e-06, -7.886803359724581e-05, -5.512236498361744e-07, -3.7697225252486533e-06, -5.200166469876422e-06, -1.9361264946837764e-07, -0.00029708960209973156, -2.339278580620885e-06, -0.016508420929312706, -3.8889261304575484e-06, -4.008129963040119e-06, -0.0006613265140913427, -8.2994620242971e-06, -3.4121114822482923e-06, -1.9743012671824545e-05, -4.008129963040119e-06, -6.682846287731081e-05, -6.704273118884885e-07, -3.05450066